]\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>先以正则交从含 ε 的成员取得 {ε}。正闭包再并 {ε} 给出星闭包，随后对 R 的正则表达式结构归纳。存在含 ε 的成员是书中定理 11.5 的显式前提，不能从普通 AFL 的定义中直接省去。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-abstract-family-of-languages","status":"resolved","id":"c29895adfd4058b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-abstract-family-of-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"843165cc8d06b8df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-abstract-family-of-languages","status":"resolved","id":"c29895adfd4058b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AFL}(\\mathcal F)$、$\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A$，$R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，$s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)$ 且 $\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;s(a)\\in\\mathcal F$。族、代换见 [[73-df-abstract-family-of-languages]]、[[73-df-language-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"843165cc8d06b8df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AFL}(\\mathcal F)$、$\\Sigma,\\Delta\\in\\mathfrak A$，$R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，$s:\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta^*)$ 且 $\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;s(a)\\in\\mathcal F$。族、代换见 [[73-df-abstract-family-of-languages]]、[[73-df-language-substitution]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{AFL}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\Delta\\